  "body": "## 1.46.0 (2026-11-25)\n\n<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at main -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### Features\n* feat(conversation): list and unshare the conversations shared with a team org (OHE-4205) by @hieptl in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/19954\n* feat: add Feedback button and submission flow by @DevinVinson in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/19272\n* feat(automations): add a Git Sync switch to keep activation status local (OHE-3927) by @hieptl in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/19925\n### Maintenance\n* chore: bump agent-server to 1.63.1, automation to 1.35.1, extensions to 0.44.0 by @openhands-release-bot[bot] in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/20026\n* chore(deps): bump @tanstack/react-virtual from 3.11.3 to 3.14.26 in the tanstack group across 1 directory by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/19864\n* chore(deps-dev): bump electron from 45.3.2 to 45.3.3 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/20024\n* chore(deps-dev): bump the eslint group with 2 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/20023\n* chore(deps): bump the i18next group with 2 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/20022\n* chore: bump agent-server to 1.64.0, automation to 1.35.2, extensions to 0.44.0 by @openhands-release-bot[bot] in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/20056\n* chore(deps): bump posthog-js from 1.450.0 to 1.450.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/20067\n* chore(deps): bump @microlink/react-json-view from 1.31.50 to 1.31.51 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/20066\n* chore(deps): bump lucide-react from 1.73.0 to 1.74.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/20064\n* chore(deps-dev): bump electron from 45.3.3 to 45.3.4 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/20065\n* chore(deps): bump the tanstack group with 2 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/20062\n* chore(deps): bump the i18next group with 2 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/20063\n* chore: bump agent-server to 1.64.1, automation to 1.36.0, extensions to 0.44.0 by @openhands-release-bot[bot] in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/20072\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/compare/v1.45.0...v1.46.0\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with [Release Please](https://github.com/googleapis/release-please). See [documentation](https://github.com/googleapis/release-please#release-please).\n<!-- AGENT_CANVAS_DOCKER_START -->\n\n<!-- macos-install-note -->\n### macOS install note\n\nThe app isn't signed with an Apple Developer ID yet, so macOS may call a\ndownloaded build *\"damaged\"* — it's Gatekeeper quarantine, not a bad file.\nAfter moving the app to Applications, clear the flag once, then open normally:\n\n```sh\nxattr -dr com.apple.quarantine \"/Applications/OpenHands Agent Canvas.app\"\n```\n\nSigning + notarization is tracked in OpenHands/OpenHands#16774.\n",
